    "parent_id": "ddfc96d1-e46c-4c6c-8e7d-711ce70872ea",
    "content": "- Maximum outperformance (125%+ ARR target): 200% target payout cap. ## 3.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "metadata": {
