    "content": "# Corporate Health, Dental and Wellness Benefits Overview ## 1. Medical and Dental Coverage\nOur comprehensive health insurance plan provides coverage for employees and eligible dependents:\n- **In-Network Deductible:** $500 individual / $1,000 family.",
    "chunk_type": "child",
    "chunk_index": 0,
